# 11. Detail Interaction Model

The complete interaction is:

```text
Timeline
   │
   │ tap a session
   ▼
Short Bottom Sheet
   │
   │ Session Detail
   │
   │ drag upward
   ▼
Expanded Bottom Sheet
   │
